# A hone counter gives +1/+0 to the creature its Equipment is attached to (CR 122.1j), and to nothing else. Lion Sash, unattached,
# is an Equipment creature: Dwalin's entering puts a hone counter on it, and it stays 1/1 - its own counter is not attached to it.
# Reconfigured onto Dwalin (CR 702.151) it makes Dwalin 3/1; reconfigured off again (unattached, CR 701.3d) Dwalin is 2/1 and the
# Sash is a 1/1 creature with its counter still on it.

